</a> <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="https://docs.uavos.com/" rel="noopener" data-astro-cid-nen7h5rs> Client Area </a> </div> </nav><script type="module">if(!(`popover`in HTMLElement.prototype)){let e=document.getElementById(`menu`);for(let t of document.querySelectorAll(`[popovertarget]`))t.addEventListener(`click`,()=>e.classList.toggle(`open`));addEventListener(`keydown`,t=>{t.key===`Escape`&&e.classList.remove(`open`)})}</script> <main id="main" data-pagefind-body data-astro-cid-hkbrpulz>  <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>  <picture data-astro-cid-lcdefpme="true"> <source srcset="/_astro/hero.DmRBVaPs_1L24B0.avif 768w, /_astro/hero.DmRBVaPs_Zbb4I6.avif 1200w" type="image/avif" sizes="100vw"><source srcset="/_astro/hero.DmRBVaPs_2g287e.webp 768w, /_astro/hero.DmRBVaPs_ZbJIiM.webp 1200w" type="image/webp" sizes="100vw">  <img src="/_astro/hero.DmRBVaPs_ZxXfeo.jpg" srcset="/_astro/hero.DmRBVaPs_ZGMDlC.jpg 768w, /_astro/hero.DmRBVaPs_ZxXfeo.jpg 1200w" alt="A tandem-wing solar high-altitude platform above the clouds" sizes="100vw" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme="true" decoding="async" data-astro-image="constrained" data-astro-image-fit="cover" data-astro-image-pos="center" width="1200" height="778" class="hero__img"> </picture> <div class="hero__shade" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme></div> <div class="container hero__inner glow" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme> <span class="eyebrow" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>UAVOS™ unmanned systems</span> <h1 id="hero-title" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Beyond human capacity. Under machine control.</h1> <p class="lead" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>UAVOS Inc. develops and manufactures unmanned systems, from autopilots, servo drives and gimbals to unmanned helicopters, fixed-wing aircraft and stratospheric platforms.</p> <div class="actions" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme> <a class="btn btn--light" href="/products/" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme> Explore products <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme="true"> <path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path>  </svg> </a><a class="btn btn--outline-light" href="/contact-us/" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme> Contact sales  </a> </div> </div> </section> <section class="section" aria-labelledby="platforms" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme> <div class="container" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme> <div class="head" data-reveal data-astro-cid-sjgajsms> <div class="text" data-astro-cid-sjgajsms> <span class="eyebrow" data-astro-cid-sjgajsms>Platforms</span> <h2 id="platforms" data-astro-cid-sjgajsms>Unmanned aircraft from ground level to the stratosphere</h2> <p class="lead" data-astro-cid-sjgajsms>Unmanned helicopters for cargo and inspection, fixed-wing aircraft for long-endurance missions, and the ApusDuo platform for the stratosphere.</p> </div> <div class="action" data-astro-cid-sjgajsms>  <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/products/" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>
